    "description": {
      "chat": "",
      "unidentified": "",
      "value": "<p>Adaptable Alliance humans.</p><ul><li>Medium; land speed 30 feet.</li><li>One bonus feat at 1st level.</li><li>Four bonus skill points at 1st level and one at every later level.</li><li>+2 racial bonus against fear.</li><li>+2 Diplomacy, Gather Information, and Knowledge (nobility and royalty); these are class skills.</li><li>+2 Craft involving mithril and +1 attack rolls against orcs (contextual/manual).</li><li>Common; any unrestricted bonus language; any favored class.</li></ul>"
